  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pas 102.01 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 225-A:3-a, the board shall consist of 4 members appointed by the governor and council.\n\nSource. #6319, eff 8-22-96; ss by #10070, eff 1-11-12",
